TITLE Sulfuric acid addition to pure water - viscosity calculation

SOLUTION 1
    pH 7.0
    temp 25
    units mol/L

REACTION 1
    H2SO4  1
    0.001  0.005  0.01  0.05  0.1  moles

SELECTED_OUTPUT
    -file   sulfuric_acid_steps.sel
    -reset  false
    -step   true
    -pH     true

USER_PUNCH
    -headings  viscosity
    -start
10  PUNCH VISCOS
    -end

END
